@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US05

autonumber

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant ":System" as System

activate Admin

Admin -> System : asks to register a new function
activate System
System --> Admin : requests data (designation)
deactivate System

Admin -> System : types requested data
activate System
System --> Admin : validates data, registers the function and informs operation success
deactivate System

deactivate Admin

@enduml